INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'Overkill VR', 'On Overkill VR you play as a leader of the resistance, a group of rebels who fight the system ruled by The Faction. In your fight, you must defeat a big number of enemies who force you to use all your weaponry.  It won’t be easy to make one single step. It will be better for you to check your guns often and get the latest upgrades for your weapons.  There are many upgrades that you will need on your mission. Be sure that you can make your best score on each stage. Power ups, multiple kills, wombo-combos and headshots add points to your score, so try to make the best gameplay! 
